      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Sofia the First is an American animated television series produced for Disney Channel. Jamie Mitchell is the Director and Executive Producer and Craig Gerber serves as Story Editor and Producer. The show follows the adventures of Sofia, played by Ariel Winter. Sofia becomes a princess when her mother, Miranda, marries King Roland II of Enchantia. The show features songs by John Kavanaugh and Erica Rothschild and a musical score by Kevin Kliesch.",
